REM Lets play a game!
ATTACKMODE HID STORAGE
DELAY 2000
CTRL ALT t
DELAY 1000
STRING Let's play a game
DELAY 4000
BACKSPACE
REPEAT 16
STRING Guess a number between 1 and 2 million!
DELAY 4000
BACKSPACE
REPEAT 38
STRING If you get it right, I won't steal your bitcoin wallet!!
DELAY 4000
BACKSPACE
REPEAT 55
STRING READY? Guess in 10 seconds...
DELAY 3000
BACKSPACE
REPEAT 28
STRING TRANSFERRING BITCOIN FUNDS
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
STRING .
DELAY 500
BACKSPACE
REPEAT 34
STRING exit
ENTER